{"suttaId":"tha-ap271","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[8517,8532],"vripara":"34"},"segments":{"tha-ap271:0.3":"Upāgatāsayattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap271:1.1":"“Himavantassa vemajjhe, saro āsi sunimmito;","tha-ap271:1.3":"Tatthāhaṃ rakkhaso āsiṃ, heṭhasīlo bhayānako.","tha-ap271:2.1":"“Anukampako kāruṇiko, vipassī lokanāyako;","tha-ap271:2.3":"Mamuddharitukāmo so, āgacchi mama santikaṃ.","tha-ap271:3.1":"“Upāgataṃ mahāvīraṃ, devadevaṃ narāsabhaṃ;","tha-ap271:3.3":"Āsayā abhinikkhamma, avandiṃ satthuno ahaṃ.","tha-ap271:4.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ vandiṃ purisuttamaṃ;","tha-ap271:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, vandanāya idaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap271:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap271:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā upāgatāsayo [upāgatahāsaniyo (syā.), upāgatāhāsaniyo (ka.)] thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap271:7.1":"Upāgatāsayattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
